COMMENT
SP19 BC stop/restart with the spatial dwarf mistletoe model: run once
straight through, then stop in 2034 and restart; the restarted run and its
.stop file must match across builds.
END

STDIDENT
YSM029-271

ECHOSUM

DATABASE
DSNin
FVS-BC.YSM-SkyRanch.db
StandSQL
SELECT * FROM FVS_StandInit WHERE Stand_ID = 'YSM029-271'
EndSQL
TreeSQL
SELECT * FROM FVS_TreeInit WHERE Stand_ID = 'YSM029-271'
EndSQL
END

TIMEINT                      5
NUMCYCLE           8
NOTRIPLE
TREELIST

MISTOE
NEWSPRED
DMAUTO                   -0.50
MISTPRT
END

FMIN
SNAGSUM
POTFIRE
END

DATABASE
DSNOut
BCRestart.db
Summary
TreeLiDB           2
MisRpts            2
END

PROCESS
STOP
